  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the VJETP Secretariat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of this action is to provide assistance to the Viet Nam Just Energy Transition Partnership Secretariat and its 4 Working Groups towards implementation of the JETP Political Declaration and the JETP Resource Mobilisation Plan.The Specific Objectives of this action are to: 1.Enable the effective operation of the JETP Secretariat and its four Working Groups,2.Provide support to strengthen policy reforms and provide technical assistance to project development.The Action will achieve the specific objectives by strengthening planning and coordination of the JETP Secretariat and its 4 working Groups; increasing stakeholder engagement and awareness of JETP; and enhancing monitoring, evaluation and reporting on progress of JETP. Moreover, support will be given for enhancing policy review and adopting progressive regulations for accelerating JETP implementation; and for strengthening technical advice and guidance to key stakeholders for RMP investments.</narrative>
  </description>
